import json
D=[
("D039","Y","The vehicle was inspected by Volkswagen in December 2024, and the area of origin was determined to be within the HV battery.","Inspection conducted to find the area of origin/cause is an investigation conducted -> INVESTIGATION_START."),
("D040","X","In June 2025, the supplier conducted a CT analysis of the cell modules from 3 of the 4 thermal events referenced above","Analysis conducted to find the root cause -> INVESTIGATION_START."),
("D041","Y","VW and the supplier investigated other potential causes/influences within the vehicle but outside of the HV battery.","Investigation conducted to find the cause -> INVESTIGATION_START."),
("D042","X","In November 2025, the supplier identified the specific modules with the shifted electrode condition, and based on that, the vehicle population was identified.","A finding/scope result; the sentence does not say the supplier informed the filer, so not SUPPLIER_NOTICE -> OTHER."),
("D043","Y","a recall for vehicles built with affected HV battery cell modules was decided.","Decision to recall -> DECISION."),
("D044","X","a recall for additional vehicles built with the additional HV battery cell modules was decided.","Decision to recall; the supplier's notice is the separate Dec 09 sentence -> DECISION."),
("D045","X","11/03/2025 GILLIG was notified by company American Seating of a safety issue affecting wheelchair locking retractors manufactured by Q’Straint.","Narrative names the component maker Q’Straint (block company Qstraint/Q'Straint) -> SUPPORTED."),
("D046","Y","11/03/2025 GILLIG was notified by company American Seating of a safety issue affecting wheelchair locking retractors manufactured by Q’Straint.","Chronology names supplier American Seating and sub-supplier Q’Straint -> NAMED."),
("D047","X","11/03/2025 GILLIG was notified by company American Seating of a safety issue","American Seating supplies the assembly; a supplier telling the filer of the problem -> SUPPLIER_NOTICE."),
("D048","X","12/12/2025 GILLIG completed population analysis and identified four (4) vehicles potentially affected.","Analysis conducted to determine the scope -> INVESTIGATION_START."),
("D049","X","American Seating supplies GILLIG with the securement device assembly that includes the defect Q’Straint parts.","Description of the supply relationship with no action -> not an event."),
("D050","Y","B. Field Service Action decision confirmed by Volvo Car Corporation 2025-12-26","Item B carries its own date (2025-12-26 follows it, not an entry it belongs to); confirming the field service action decision is a recall decision -> DECISION."),
("D051","Y","On the December 26th, 2025, the CCMT team took the decision to release a safety notification recall","X's '2025-12-26 C.' is a date fragment, not an action; the Dec 26th sentence is the decision to recall -> DECISION."),
("D052","X","In July 2025 Volvo Cars received the first report indicating potential overheating of HV-battery cell outside the USA.","First report reaching the filer -> FILER_AWARENESS; X's quote is the clean sentence."),
("D053","X","C. Condition detected by? (Market VR**, internal, inspection, testing)","Form field question, no action -> not an event."),
("D054","Y","C. Condition detected by? (Market VR**, internal, inspection, testing) Market VR","Form field answer, no action -> not an event."),
("D055","X","D. Number of VR with the condition, reported to Volvo Cars from NSC? 0","Form field count (status), no action -> not an event."),
("D056","Y","E. Total number of cars included in VRs concerning the condition? 0","Form field count, no action -> not an event."),
("D057","Y","E. Total number of cars included in VRs concerning the condition?","Form field question/status, no action -> not an event."),
("D058","X","E. Total number of cars included in VRs concerning the condition? 0 F.","Fragment of a form field count, no action -> not an event."),
("D059","X","F. Implementation date of Field Service Action 2025-12-26","Form field for remedy implementation date (remedy logistics), not a filer-awareness event; the July 2025 report is already a separate event."),
("D060","X","On the December 26th, 2025, the CCMT team took the decision to release a safety notification recall","This sentence is one DECISION event (covered in D051); an additional OTHER event for the same sentence violates one-event-per-sentence."),
("D061","X","Reference: REPORT NUMBER 223-2401438-TEST","A reference pointer with no action -> not an event."),
("D062","Y","Lucid engineers observed a software test vehicle with a blank rearview image when it was put in reverse.","Internal discovery of the problem by filer engineers -> FILER_AWARENESS."),
("D063","CONTESTED","A stop sale was issued on December 10, 2025, while Lucid investigated if other vehicles in the field had the same issue.","The versions label two different sentences, each correctly (stop sale = OTHER; 'By December 2025 ... verify other customer cases' = FILER_AWARENESS); the pairing, not the label, is at issue."),
]
json.dump([{"item_id":a,"decision":b,"quote":c,"reason":d} for a,b,c,d in D],open("decisions.json","w"),indent=1,ensure_ascii=False)
